Third-party code
----------------

Dear ImGui and the ReShade SDK are NOT redistributed here: scripts/fetch-deps
retrieves them at build time. The .asi build links Dear ImGui (MIT, Copyright
(c) 2014-2025 Omar Cornut), and the release archives therefore contain it in
compiled form.

The fonts in assets/fonts/ are Dear ImGui's bundled set: Roboto and Karla under
the Apache Licence 2.0, Cousine under the Apache Licence 2.0, and Droid Sans
under the Apache Licence 2.0. Their own licence files ship with Dear ImGui.
